    schema:description "YOUR TASKS You analyze business processes, organizational structures, or technical systems and identify optimization potential through the use of AI. Additionally at Senior Level: You advise clients on the secure introduction and use of AI solutions and support them in realistically assessing the opportunities and risks of AI. You advise business units and develop tailored AI strategies to improve the effectiveness and efficiency of cybersecurity and related applications. Additionally at Senior Level: You support executives and project stakeholders with strategic and conceptual questions regarding the use of AI within existing security structures. You support project or program management for our clients. Additionally at Senior Level: You lead and oversee AI security projects from analysis through conception to implementation, acting as the central interface between business units, IT, and security. You prepare and facilitate workshops and training sessions. Additionally at Senior Level: You design, organize, and facilitate workshops, assessments, and training sessions on AI security, e.g., for risk assessment of AI use cases or the secure use of generative AI. You create reporting materials for decision-makers and committees to enable informed decision-making. Additionally at Senior Level: You document results, prepare management and decision-making materials, and present them appropriately to different stakeholders. Additionally at Senior Level: You develop and evaluate practical concepts and guidelines for securing AI applications without going deeply into technical implementation. You support project and stakeholder management, coordinate involved parties, and ensure transparency regarding progress, risks, and decisions. You monitor market and technology trends in AI security and derive relevant impulses for client projects and new consulting approaches. YOUR PROFIL You have a good to very good completed (Master’s) degree in business administration, (business) informatics, a technical, scientific, mathematical, or related discipline. You bring 1–2 years of professional experience for a Consultant role or 2–5 years for a Senior Consultant role. You have an interest in topics related to the secure development of AI, the secure use of AI applications, or the use of AI to improve cybersecurity. You work in a structured and pragmatic manner and can quickly familiarize yourself with new topics. You have an open and empathetic personality. You are a team player, motivated, performance-oriented, flexible, communicative, and proactive. You are comfortable with technical concepts and enjoy bridging the gap between development and management. You are motivated by impact and personal growth through working in a team as well as with and for our clients. You are proficient in working with MS Office, especially Outlook and PowerPoint. You are willing to travel. You have very good German and English language skills (at least C1 level in both languages). Additionally at the senior level: You confidently work on topics related to the secure development of AI, the secure use of AI applications, or the use of AI to improve cybersecurity. You have solid knowledge of modern project management methodologies, understand business processes in IT and cybersecurity, and are confident in designing, implementing, analyzing, and optimizing them. You are a creative and motivated team player with strong initiative and a passion for driving innovative ideas and building long-term client relationships. You stand out through analytical and visionary thinking as well as excellent presentation and communication skills, enabling you to clearly convey complex technical concepts and confidently advise clients. You possess strong presentation and facilitation skills and interact confidently with clients. YOUR BENEFITS Supportive Team Culture: Team cohesion is important to us - we support one another and foster a healthy office culture. Our event team organizes regular after-work events to encourage exchange and connection beyond the workplace. Early Ownership & Responsibility: From day one, you will take on exciting tasks with real responsibility – whether on your project or by contributing to internal initiatives. You help shape the way we work. Clear Career Development Paths: You will find an environment that supports, challenges, and advances your professional growth. We offer clearly defined career paths and a transparent competency framework for every level. Creative Work Environment: We give you the freedom and time to develop creative solutions and provide the best, most modern hardware to support you (Apple or Windows). Employee Benefits: Flexible working models, a BahnCard, JobRad, Spendit card, Wellpass, and a company pension scheme contribute to your well-being. In addition, you’ll enjoy the best coffee from our new espresso machine and a fully stocked soft drinks fridge in the office. Attractive Vacation Policy: You benefit from 30 days of paid vacation per year and the flexibility to work from home. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
