    schema:datePosted "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3><strong>Who We Are</strong></h3> <p>VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy's. In 2026, VML was named<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><em>Campaign’s</em> Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&nbsp;</p> <p>VML is part of <a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$\">WPP</a>, the trusted growth partner for the world's leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&nbsp;</p> <p>For more information, please visit<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><a class=\"ms-outlook-linkify\" href=\"http://www.vml.com/\" data-outlook-id=\"fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886\"><u>www.vml.com</u></a><u>&nbsp;</u>and follow along on <a href=\"https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;e=\" data-outlook-id=\"b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be\"><u>LinkedIn</u></a>&nbsp;#WeAreVML.</p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Consultant·e Sénior –&nbsp;Transformation, Marketing &amp; Expérience Client</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">VML Consulting est le cabinet de conseil en transformation de l’expérience&nbsp;client&nbsp;&nbsp;de&nbsp;VML&nbsp;France (groupe WPP, leader mondial des services de communication et de marketing).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nous accompagnons des&nbsp;clients&nbsp;grands comptes&nbsp;et acteurs de 1</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-fontsize=\"12\">er</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;plan&nbsp;dans la définition et la mise en œuvre de transformations stratégiques, au croisement du business,&nbsp;du marketing,&nbsp;de la data, de la technologie et de la créativité.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Structuré autour de trois pôles — Business Consulting, Data,&nbsp;Technology&nbsp;&amp; Digital — le cabinet intervient de bout en bout, de la vision à l’exécution, avec une forte conviction : la performance passe par une expérience client réinventée, portée par la data et l’IA.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nous recrutons un&nbsp;Consultant Senior&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Transformation, Marketing &amp; Expérience Client&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">pour rejoindre notre Practice Business Consulting.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Votre mission</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous intervenez sur des projets&nbsp;à fort enjeu sur des problématiques&nbsp;variées&nbsp;de transformation,&nbsp;d’expérience client,&nbsp;de CRM, d’IA,&nbsp;ou encore de&nbsp;change management sur des clients exigeants (luxe,&nbsp;retail, services financiers, hôtellerie…), en B2C et en B2B</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Définir la vision stratégique et les roadmaps&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identifier des opportunités et use&nbsp;cases innovants&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Concevoir des&nbsp;stratégies d’engagement et des&nbsp;parcours clients,&nbsp;en en mesurant&nbsp;les impacts&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Repenser&nbsp;les process et les organisations, notamment&nbsp;dans des contextes d’intégration de l’IA&nbsp;/ de l’agentique</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Piloter la mise en œuvre opérationnelle des initiatives, du lancement à la mise à l’échelle&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Accompagner les équipes clientes dans le changement et l’adoption&nbsp;des outils&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Mesurer la performance et le ROI pour assurer le succès durable&nbsp;des actions déployées</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Votre profil</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous justifiez d’au moins 5 ans d’expérience, sur des sujets de&nbsp;transformation,&nbsp;change management,&nbsp;marketing et expérience client, idéalement dans le conseil&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous êtes&nbsp;reconnu.e&nbsp;pour votre leadership, votre esprit analytique et votre capacité à synthétiser des enjeux complexes&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous disposez de solides bases méthodologiques (cadrage stratégique, définition de roadmap,&nbsp;construction de use&nbsp;cases,…)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous avez une bonne connaissance / appétence aux sujets d’IA</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous savez vous adapter rapidement à des contextes variés&nbsp;et exigeants</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Curieux.se et proactif.ve, vous proposez des solutions innovantes pour créer de la valeur&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">L’anglais courant est indispensable&nbsp;(clients et environnements internationaux)&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pourquoi rejoindre VML Consulting</span></strong><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> </span></strong><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">?</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Monter en compétences&nbsp;rapidement en intervenant sur des projets stratégiques&nbsp;diversifiés</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Gagnez une vision 360° de l’expérience client et de la transformation&nbsp;des organisations&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Accédez à des outils d’IA pour booster votre créativité et votre efficacité&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Intégrez une équipe enthousiaste, bienveillante et soudée&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Vous êtes&nbsp;prêt.e&nbsp;à relever des défis stratégiques&nbsp;au cœur des enjeux de demain&nbsp;?</span>&nbsp;<br><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Postulez dès maintenant et rejoignez l’aventure VML Consulting</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">!</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Poste basé à Levallois-Perret. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Hybride</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: mix présentiel / télétravail. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">#LI-EMEA</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span class=\"normaltextrun\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.</span></span></span></p> <p><span class=\"normaltextrun\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.</span></span><span class=\"scxw176048299\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p>When you click \"Submit Application\", this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it's a good idea to read through our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy\">Recruitment Privacy Policy</a>. California residents should read our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice\">California Recruitment Privacy Notice</a>. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.</p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
