    schema:description "Position Jung von Matt SPORTS is looking for a Creative Director Art (m/f/d) About You Strong understanding of creative strategy and its business impact. Ability to translate complex challenges into clear creative direction. Excellent judgment in evaluating and sharpening ideas. Strong interdisciplinary creative leadership across all media and channels. High standards for creative quality and execution. Strategic and entrepreneurial mindset. Confident communication and decision-making skills. Ability to lead, inspire and develop teams. Strong client management and presentation skills at senior level. Understanding of emerging technologies and their creative potential. Your Tasks Lead the overall creative quality and direction of projects, teams and accounts. Define and steer creative concepts and campaign directions. Guide decision-making processes with clients and leadership teams. Oversee productions and ensure high creative standards. Foster collaboration across disciplines and departments. Develop team structures, workflows and creative processes. Mentor and grow creative talent within the agency. Drive innovation and identify relevant cultural and technological developments. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
