    schema:title "Director, Sales (Middle East)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/pingidentity/director-sales-middle-east-304335> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-director-strategic-partnerships-london-18351> a prov:Entity,
