    schema:description "We are looking for a confident, credible male presenter to become the long-term face of our YouTube content. You will record scripted talking-head videos several times per week and work closely with our team on an ongoing basis. Tasks Record 3–4 YouTube videos per week Videos are typically 10–20 minutes long Present provided scripts naturally and confidently Maintain a consistent, professional on-camera appearance Requirements Native or near-native English Strong experience speaking on camera Mature, trustworthy and professional presence Comfortable reading scripts or using a teleprompter Reliable and available long term Good recording environment at home preferred Existing camera, microphone and lighting setup is a plus Benefits Long-term, stable role Fully remote Scripts and creative direction provided Equipment can be provided if needed Opportunity to become a recognizable long-term face of the brands We are looking for someone who wants to stay with us for years, not just complete a few freelance projects. Please apply with your previous experience, examples of on-camera work, current setup and expected monthly compensation. Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
