    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3 id=\"isPasted\"><strong>Company Overview</strong></h3> <p>Metrea delivers effects-as-a-service to national security partners across five domains and more than a dozen mission areas. These include airborne ISR, electronic warfare, secure communications, aerial refueling, special air missions, aerial firefighting, and advanced simulation. We own the whole stack: designing, building, and operating turnkey capabilities that give our partners decisive, asymmetric advantage against rapidly evolving threats.</p> <p>Our operating model is built around three interlocking pillars. The Support Groups provide a global shared-service – spanning people, finance, platform, operations, legal, and engagement. This frees up our Core Groups, who develop and own mission capabilities end-to-end, to focus entirely on delivery. The Market Groups apply a regional lens, ensuring that our agile and adaptable capabilities remain aligned to the wicked problems that matter most to our partners across the Americas, EMEA, and Asia-Pacific.</p> <p>At the heart of our model is a simple but powerful idea: be a true partner with skin in the game. Our partners need effects, not just equipment. By owning the full stack – from the lab to the field – we are able to drive a continuous cycle of innovation that keeps our partners ahead. It's a fast-moving, intellectually demanding environment where talented people are given real responsibility, work on problems that matter, and contribute to an enterprise that is growing quickly and deliberately.</p> <p>Headquartered in Washington, DC, with facilities across the United States, the United Kingdom, as well as Continental Europe and Asia-Pacific.</p></div><h3><strong>Group&nbsp;Overview</strong></h3> <p>Electromagnetic and Cyber Group (EM&amp;C) is responsible for developing flexible and survivable advanced electronic warfare and secure communications equipment while providing the industry’s leading signals intelligence, electronic warfare, and cyber experts. Metrea specialises in signal classification, direction finding, advanced geolocation techniques, and waveform development including waveforms for MANET and LPI/LPD applications. Metrea also develops special purpose radios for government customers and licenses DF and geolocation solutions to multiple OEMs.</p> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">The Expeditionary Operations Lab, or EXOLAB, focuses on the rapid development, integration, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">evaluation</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\"> and delivery of expeditionary capabilities within the Electromagnetic Warfare and Cyber domain.</span> <span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">EXOLAB works across research and development, experimentation, prototyping, systems integration, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">trials</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\"> and operational delivery. The team addresses complex customer problems by combining existing technologies, emerging </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">capabilities</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\"> and internally developed solutions into deployable systems.</span> <span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">The lab </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">operates</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\"> across airborne, land, maritime and dismounted environments, with a strong emphasis on practical engineering, rapid learning and delivering systems that are operationally relevant, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\">supportable</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW239653401 BCX8\"> and resilient.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW239653401 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h3><strong>Position Summary</strong></h3> <p>We are seeking a Principal RF Engineer to lead and support the research, design, development, integration and delivery of radio-frequency systems for expeditionary Electronic Warfare, signals intelligence, spectrum operations and secure communications capabilities.&nbsp;</p> <p>The role will be responsible for the RF engineering aspects of prototype and operational systems, including RF architecture, receiver and transmitter chains, antenna systems, signal distribution, filtering, amplification, frequency conversion, interference management and system performance analysis.&nbsp;</p> <p>The Principal RF Engineer will operate as a senior technical authority within a multidisciplinary team comprising electrical, systems, mechanical, software, cyber and operational specialists. The role will support the full engineering lifecycle, from concept development and technology evaluation through detailed design, integration, verification, trials, deployment and through-life support.&nbsp;</p> <p>This is a practical, delivery-focused engineering role. The successful candidate will be comfortable moving between theoretical analysis, simulation, laboratory testing, prototype development, platform integration and field trials.&nbsp;</p> <p>The role will be based either in Lincoln or London, with a longer-term intent to transition the primary location to London if hired initially in Lincoln.&nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>What You'll Do</strong></h3> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Design, develop and integrate RF systems for expeditionary Unmanned Systems control, Electronic Warfare, signals intelligence, spectrum-monitoring and secure communications capabilities.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop RF system architectures covering antennas, receivers, transmitters, amplifiers, filters, frequency conversion, switching and signal distribution.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct RF performance analysis, including gain, noise figure, sensitivity, dynamic range, linearity, link budgets and interference assessments.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support rapid R&amp;D, prototyping and technology evaluation, translating operational requirements into practical and deployable RF solutions.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Integrate commercial, government and internally developed RF equipment across airborne, vehicle-mounted, maritime, fixed-site and unmanned platforms.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Plan and conduct RF testing, characterisation, fault diagnosis, verification and corrective engineering activity.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure RF designs consider electromagnetic compatibility, spectrum management, grounding, bonding, shielding, environmental protection and relevant standards.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work closely with electrical, mechanical, software, cyber, systems and operational teammates throughout the engineering lifecycle.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support UK and international trials, demonstrations, installations, commissioning and operational deployments.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide RF technical leadership, design assurance and clear engineering recommendations to customers, suppliers and internal stakeholders.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h3><strong>What You Bring</strong></h3> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Degree in RF Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering or a closely related discipline, or equivalent relevant experience</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum of seven years’ experience in RF systems design, development, integration, testing or delivery</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience working with complex RF systems within defence, aerospace, telecommunications, Electronic Warfare, signals intelligence, secure communications or a related sector</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with Software Defined Radios, digital RF architectures and the collection or analysis of IQ data</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[268442635,&quot;24&quot;,335559705,&quot;1033&quot;,335551547,&quot;1033&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman,Arial Unicode MS&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469789810,&quot;none&quot;,335572083,&quot;0&quot;,335572084,&quot;0&quot;,335572085,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789802,&quot;none&quot;,335572075,&quot;0&quot;,335572076,&quot;0&quot;,335572077,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789798,&quot;none&quot;,335572071,&quot;0&quot;,335572072,&quot;0&quot;,335572073,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789806,&quot;none&quot;,335572079,&quot;0&quot;,335572080,&quot;0&quot;,335572081,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789814,&quot;none&quot;,335572087,&quot;0&quot;,335572088,&quot;0&quot;,335572089,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789818,&quot;none&quot;,335572091,&quot;0&quot;,335572092,&quot;0&quot;,335572093,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Experience designing, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">integrating</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> or supporting </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">RF</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> systems for unmanned systems, including uncrewed aerial, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">ground</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> or maritime platforms</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong understanding of RF receiver and transmitter architectures, including amplifiers, filters, mixers, oscillators, switches and frequency-conversion stages</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335572071&quot;:0,&quot;335572072&quot;:0,&quot;335572073&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572075&quot;:0,&quot;335572076&quot;:0,&quot;335572077&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572079&quot;:0,&quot;335572080&quot;:0,&quot;335572081&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572083&quot;:0,&quot;335572084&quot;:0,&quot;335572085&quot;:4278190080,&quot;335572087&quot;:0,&quot;335572088&quot;:0,&quot;335572089&quot;:4278190080,&quot;469789798&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789802&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789810&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;469789814&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience conducting cascade analysis, link-budget calculations and assessments of gain, noise figure, sensitivity, linearity and dynamic range</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Practical experience with antenna systems, RF distribution, transmission lines, impedance matching, grounding, bonding and shielding</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong RF test, measurement and fault-finding skills using equipment such as spectrum analysers, vector network analysers, signal generators, oscilloscopes and power meters</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience using RF simulation, modelling, schematic-capture or system-analysis tools</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to work effectively within multidisciplinary teams spanning electrical, mechanical, software, cyber, systems and operational disciplines</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to produce clear technical documentation, communicate engineering recommendations and travel regularly within the UK and internationally</span></li> </ul> <h3><strong>Additional&nbsp;Eligibility&nbsp;Qualifications</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience designing expeditionary, deployable, ruggedised or rapidly reconfigurable RF capabilities</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience integrating RF systems onto airborne, vehicle-mounted, maritime, fixed-site or dismounted platforms</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Understanding of antenna selection, placement, radiation patterns, platform effects and co-site interference</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with wideband receivers, transmit chains, power amplifiers, low-noise amplifiers, filters and RF switching networks</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience conducting electromagnetic compatibility, electromagnetic environmental effects and radio-frequency interference assessments</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with relevant defence, aviation, maritime, spectrum-management or RF engineering standards</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience supporting prototype builds, field trials, exercises, customer demonstrations or operational deployments</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[268442635,&quot;24&quot;,335559705,&quot;1033&quot;,335551547,&quot;1033&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman,Arial Unicode MS&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469789810,&quot;none&quot;,335572083,&quot;0&quot;,335572084,&quot;0&quot;,335572085,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789802,&quot;none&quot;,335572075,&quot;0&quot;,335572076,&quot;0&quot;,335572077,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789798,&quot;none&quot;,335572071,&quot;0&quot;,335572072,&quot;0&quot;,335572073,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789806,&quot;none&quot;,335572079,&quot;0&quot;,335572080,&quot;0&quot;,335572081,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789814,&quot;none&quot;,335572087,&quot;0&quot;,335572088,&quot;0&quot;,335572089,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469789818,&quot;none&quot;,335572091,&quot;0&quot;,335572092,&quot;0&quot;,335572093,&quot;4278190080&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Knowledge of systems engineering, size, weight, power and cooling analysis, low-volume manufacturing, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">component</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">obsolescence</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> and through-life support</span></span></li> </ul> </div> <h3><strong>Benefits</strong></h3> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Private medical insurance </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Subsidised gym membership / plans through Wellhub </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Electric car scheme </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Cycle to work scheme </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Salary sacrifice pension scheme </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Free lunch on office days</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">Enhanced parental leave</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\">30 days annual PTO plus bank holidays </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h3><strong>Work&nbsp;Authorization&nbsp;/&nbsp;Security&nbsp;Clearance</strong></h3> <p>The successful candidate must have the right to work in the United Kingdom.&nbsp;</p> <p>The role will require the individual to hold, or be capable of obtaining and maintaining, an appropriate UK national-security clearance. Certain projects may impose additional nationality or security restrictions.&nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>AAP/EEO Statement</strong></h3> <p>Metrea Mission Data Limited is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or other characteristics protected by law. &nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>Position&nbsp;Type&nbsp;and&nbsp;Expected&nbsp;Hours&nbsp;of&nbsp;Work</strong></h3> <p>This is a full-time position with typical working hours of Monday through Friday, 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. This position is offered on a hybrid working basis with three days per week in the office as standard, based out of London or Lincoln.</p> <h3><strong>Work Environment<br></strong></h3> <p>The role will involve work across:&nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Office and engineering-design environments&nbsp;</li> <li>Laboratories and workshops</li> <li>Customer and supplier facilities</li> <li>Vehicle, aircraft and maritime-platform integration environments</li> <li>Outdoor test, trial and exercise locations</li> <li>Operationally representative and potentially austere environments&nbsp;&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>Appropriate training, procedures and personal protective equipment will be provided where required.&nbsp;</p> <p>The role is not exclusively desk-based. It may involve:&nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Standing, walking, bending, kneeling and working in restricted equipment spaces</li> <li>Handling tools, cables, connectors and test equipment</li> <li>Installing or removing electrical and electronic equipment</li> <li>Lifting and carrying equipment within appropriate manual-handling limits</li> <li>Working around vehicles, aircraft, generators and other powered systems</li> <li>Periods of outdoor work in varying environmental conditions</li> </ul> <p><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\">Reasonable </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\">accommodations</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\"> may be made to enable qualified individuals with </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\">additional</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\"> needs</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW207394640 BCX8\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"Free Form\"> to perform the essential functions.</span></p> <h3><strong>Travel</strong></h3> <p>15%</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h3><strong>Our Firmware</strong></h3> <p>At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.</p> <p>Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.</p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
