    schema:description "Your mission You contribute to the further development of our platform in the front-end area. You will develop technical concepts independently and as part of a team, implement them, carry out tests, and document the results of your work. You are constantly collaborating with UI/UX designers, and the backend and frontend team то deliver the best possible result. You actively participate in the development of reusable components and contribute to the optimization of our development. Your profile You have +5 years of relevant work experience and a passion for frontend development with TypeScript and Angular in the Nx workspace. You are interested in modern development concepts (REST, API, Microfrontends, Module Federation, Responsive Design, and state management with NgRx). You enjoy usability, front-end design, and new technologies. UI frameworks like Angular Material, TailwindCSS, Chart.js, and others are familiar to you. You enjoy working in an agile development team in an attractive work environment and continuous development in new technologies. Business fluent in both English and German is a must. Why us • Because we value talent more than hierarchy. • Because at neoshare, responsibility isn't delegated - it's owned. • Because we use modern AI and technology as a lever for exceptional results. • Because we develop people who want to learn, grow, and deliver. • Because performance, quality, and impact belong together for us. • Because we are working together towards building a European tech champion What You Can Expect • Performance-driven, above-average compensation that rewards outstanding commitment. • High-end offices designed to support collaboration, wellbeing, and peak performance - including great health and fitness benefits. • Legendary team events where we celebrate our wins together and strengthen team spirit. • State-of-the-art AI tools, first-class equipment, and an environment that fosters ownership and personal growth. • Concentration of top talent, fast decision-making, and the chance to make a real impact early on. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
