    schema:datePosted "2026-09-07"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.</p> <p>What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.</p> <p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating<em> </em>our wins – big and small.</p> <p>Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, <a href=\"https://www.anaplan.com/careers/\">values</a>-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!</p></div><p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"509\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Role Overview</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"509\">We are looking for a&nbsp;</span><span data-markdown-start-index=\"559\">Senior Solution Consultant to join our highly specialized European Supply Chain Pre-sales community. You will act as the technical and domain expert on high-stakes, high-impact enterprise opportunities, specifically focusing on strategic supply chain opportunities.<br><br>Reporting directly to the Director, Supply Chain Solution Consulting EMEA, you will demonstrate Anaplan's unique value proposition through customized Proof of Concept (POC) and flawless high-quality demonstrations.</span></p> <p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"953\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h4>Your Impact</h4> <ul> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1472\">Targeted Enterprise Engagement:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1505\">&nbsp;Engage with large, strategic enterprise prospects in&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1561\">France</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1569\">&nbsp;(and support growth in the wider Southern Europe/EMEA region), specifically targeting the&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1662\">manufacturing and industrial sectors</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1700\">&nbsp;to identify complex, broken business planning processes and map them to Anaplan's capabilities.</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1802\">High-Value Solution Engineering:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"1836\"> Design and build domain-specific, tailored Proof of Concept (POC) models and demonstrations that illustrate how Anaplan solves complex Supply Chain planning problems (S&amp;OP, production planning, capacity constraints) and links them directly to financial outcomes.</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2329\">Collaborative Preparation:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2357\"> Work hand-in-hand with our local Principal Consultant and the wider European team of 7 Supply Chain experts (UK, Italy, France) to divide, conquer, and perfect high-stakes demos.</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2557\">Internal &amp; External Stakeholder Management:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2602\">&nbsp;Deliver high-impact presentations and technical discussions with Supply Chain Directors, VP of Supply Chain, and C-Level executives, while cross-training and aligning with internal Sales, Product, and the Presales Center of Excellence (COE) teams.</span></p> </li> </ul> <h3><span data-markdown-start-index=\"509\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">Your Qualifications</span></span></h3> <ul> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2888\">Senior Domain Expertise:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"2920\"> Several years of successful Pre-sales / Solution Consulting experience, with a deep specialization in Supply Chain planning (including S&amp;OP, Supply Planning, and Production Planning).</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3540\">Consultative &amp; Methodical Approach:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3577\">&nbsp;Ability to take a consultative, value-driven selling approach by listening to customer needs, combined with a strong desire to \"get hands-on\" with model building and thorough demo preparation.</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3776\">Communication &amp; Presentation Skills:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3814\">&nbsp;Exceptional communication skills with the ability to confidently present complex technical scenarios to both highly technical teams and C-suite stakeholders.</span></p> </li> <li> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3978\">Languages:</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"3990\">&nbsp;Fluent in&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4003\">French</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4011\">&nbsp;and highly proficient in&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4039\">English</span></strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4048\"> as it</span><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4070\">&nbsp;is our standard for European team collaboration and internal communication).</span></p> </li> <li> <p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4151\">Master’s degree in Business Administration, Engineering, Supply Chain Management, or equivalent strongly preferable.</span></p> </li> </ul> <hr> <h3><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4278\">Strong plus</span></strong></h3> <ul> <li> <p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4300\">Prior hands-on experience with advanced Supply Chain Planning software&nbsp;</span></p> </li> <li> <p><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4446\">Experience with Enterprise Performance Management (EPM), Integrated Business Planning (IBP), or multi-dimensional planning tools.</span></p> </li> <li><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4446\">Manufacturing Sector Focus<strong>:</strong> Proven track record of working with manufacturing and industrial accounts, understanding their specific operational realities, terms, and production planning challenges.</span></li> <li><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4446\">Hands-on Technical Agility<strong>:</strong> Strong multi-dimensional modelling skills and direct experience or comfortable familiarity with mathematical optimization engines/solvers (such as Gurobi, Simplex, or similar).</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-markdown-start-index=\"4685\">#LI-Remote</span></strong></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) </strong></p> <p>We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! </p> <p>We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer</strong> &nbsp;</p> <p>It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals. </p> <p>Anaplan does not: &nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person. &nbsp;</li> <li>Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence. &nbsp;</p> <p><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">C</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">in accordance with</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our Candidate Privacy Notice. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\">assist</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0\"> our team in evaluating qualifications.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-anaplan ;
